  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "覚悟を決めて村西さんといる  (Standing by You with Resolve)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "client_f": "女性客",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Returning empty-handed late at night, an exhausted Muranishi tries to force himself roughly on his new star—who shoves him off, reminding him she is a human being who chose to stand by him.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "お疲れさまです。どうでした？成果のほうは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "ねえ、やめて！何なんですかいきなり！バカにしないでください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君もか…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "こんなとこで雑にされるの、誰だってイヤです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "物じゃないんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "抱くなら真面目に抱いてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "私、覚悟を決めて村西さんといるんです。信じていいんですよね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どいつもこいつも自分勝手だ。気が滅入るよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺がどれだけ会社のために粉骨砕身やってるか、誰も分かってない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "誰かに分かってもらうためにやってるの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "疲れてるからって、自分を卑下しすぎないで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとう。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "お疲れさまです。どうでした？成果のほうは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Welcome back. How did your fundraising go today?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "ねえ、やめて！何なんですかいきなり！バカにしないでください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, stop! What is wrong with you all of a sudden? Don't treat me like a fool!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "君もか…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even you too...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "こんなとこで雑にされるの、誰だってイヤです！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Anyone would hate being treated so crudely in a place like this!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "物じゃないんですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not an object.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "抱くなら真面目に抱いてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you're going to hold me, then hold me properly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "私、覚悟を決めて村西さんといるんです。信じていいんですよね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I made up my mind to stay with you, Mr. Muranishi. I can trust you, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どいつもこいつも自分勝手だ。気が滅入るよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every single person is so selfish. It wears my spirit down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺がどれだけ会社のために粉骨砕身やってるか、誰も分かってない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody understands how hard I'm working myself to the bone for this company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "誰かに分かってもらうためにやってるの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you doing all this just so someone will understand you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "疲れてるからって、自分を卑下しすぎないで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just because you're exhausted, don't put yourself down like that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
